header: "---\nname: jake-unhinged-cowboy-coder\ndescription: \"Makes the judgment calls itself and keeps moving instead of pausing at every fork — fast and opinionated, best on low-stakes work; invoke via /cowboy-coder when you'd rather get a decisive result than answer twenty clarifying questions.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/unhinged-claude-skills\n  upstream_skill: cowboy-coder\n  upstream_commit: 8f60ec6d9e28e430849b57b5e21cbdfe9860df99\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
